{"title": "Constrict", "pageid": 34024, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Constrict", "categories": ["Class actions", "Strength saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Sources of Necrotic damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp, /w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Constrict</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Vine_Blight\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Vine Blight\">Shadow-Cursed Vine Blights</a>. It restrains and damages a target as long as the blight maintains concentration. It spreads shadow-cursed vines in an area leading to and around the target. The blight is considered <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constricting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\">Constricting</a> while concentrating on this ability and cannot move or act.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nWrap your cursed tendrils around a creature to constrict it.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 7~20</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/46px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/62px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png/31px-D4_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/D4_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">2d6 + 4</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"STR Save (DC&nbsp;14)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;14)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 14 m (47 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 14 m (47 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Constrict_Blight_Vine</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Constrict_Blight_Vine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Constrict_Blight_Vine\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetTerrain_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetTerrain (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetTerrain</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Constricted\"> Condition: Constricted </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constricted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\">Constricted</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 4  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"STR Save (DC&nbsp;14)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;14)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't move. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against it have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, while its attack rolls and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.</li>\n<li>The entity takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">2d6+2</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> per turn.</li>\n<li>Can be removed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Constricting\"> Condition: Constricting </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constricting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\">Constricting</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 4  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Wrapped around a target to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constrict\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\">Constrict</a> it and can't move.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Vine_Blight\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Vine Blight\">Shadow-Cursed Vine Blight</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Land%27s_Stride:_Advantage\" title=\"Land's Stride: Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp/25px-Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp/38px-Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp/50px-Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Land's Stride: Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp/25px-Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Land%27s_Stride_Advantage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Land%27s_Stride:_Advantage\" title=\"Land's Stride: Advantage\">Land's Stride: Advantage</a> gives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on the saving throw of this ability.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Land%27s_Stride:_Plants\" title=\"Land's Stride: Plants\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp/25px-Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp/38px-Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp/50px-Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Land's Stride: Plants\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp/25px-Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Land%27s_Stride_Plants_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Land%27s_Stride:_Plants\" title=\"Land's Stride: Plants\">Land's Stride: Plants</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/38px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/50px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Freedom of Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Freedom_of_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_of_Movement\" title=\"Freedom of Movement\">Freedom of Movement</a>, and similar features will prevent you from being restrained by this ability, but the initial damage will still be applied on a failed save. If this happens, the blight will continue to behave as if it successfully restrained its target and be stuck in place <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constricting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricting_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricting (Condition)\">Constricting</a> nothing for 4 turns.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constricted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constricted_(Condition)\" title=\"Constricted (Condition)\">Constricted</a> condition can be removed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a>.</li>\n<li>A blight will prioritize using this ability on a target afflicted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Digestive Juices\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Juices_(Condition)\" title=\"Digestive Juices (Condition)\">Digestive Juices</a> to set up the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Shambling_Mound\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound\">Shadow-Cursed Shambling Mound</a>'s deadly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/25px-Bite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/38px-Bite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/50px-Bite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp/25px-Bite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Bite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Shambling_Mound)\" title=\"Devour (Shambling Mound)\">Devour</a> attack.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2